#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: keep-it-peace.php
msgid "Keep It Peace"
msgstr "Keep It Peace"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: keep-it-peace.php
msgid "https://keep-it-peace.com"
msgstr "https://keep-it-peace.com"

#. Description of the plugin
#: keep-it-peace.php
msgid "Monitors custom themes, server-side programs outside WordPress, the site's public surface and the PHP runtime, and emails you a summary."
msgstr "カスタムテーマ、WordPress 外のサーバー上のプログラム、サイトの外部から見た状態、PHP の実行環境を監視し、概要をメールでお知らせします。"

